{"id":9104515891356,"title":"Westbrook Driving Moc - Parisian Blue","handle":"westbrook-driving-moc-parisian-blue","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe driving moc, iconic footwear that has become synonymous with New England prep and Italian Sprezzatura. The driving shoe market has largely been dominated by Italian makers due to a distinct lack of a true American driving moc... until now. Our driving mocs are genuine handsewn moccasin construction with a twist. The honey rubber dot sole is built into the shoe, sandwiched between the vamp and the leather lining. What this means is a lightweight, flexible, comfortable shoe that gives you great pedal feel when driving and a spring in your step when kicking around town. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Westbrook driving moc is crafted from Parisian Blue pull-up leather , a full-grain American cowhide leather. They are fully leather lined. Made in Maine, USA.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e*These driving mocs cannot be re-soled, we do not recommend using these shoes if you will be doing a lot of walking. D (medium) is the only available width, if you need a wider width we recommend ordering half a size larger.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-09T19:10:59-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-07T22:59:22-04:00","vendor":"Rancourt \u0026 Co.","type":"Footwear","tags":[],"price":29800,"price_min":29800,"price_max":29800,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":0,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":47035253686428,"title":"8 \/ D \/ Parisian Blue","option1":"8","option2":"D","option3":"Parisian Blue","sku":"7044-96-8D","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":45497088966812,"product_id":9104515891356,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-06-07T22:59:23-04:00","updated_at":"2026-06-07T22:59:25-04:00","alt":null,"width":1080,"height":1080,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0688\/7204\/4700\/files\/we